          "type": "link",
          "url": "https://rext.ai/blog/",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " takes a different approach than most of the tools on this list. Instead of specializing in one part of the SEO process, it's built to handle the entire content workflow, from the first keyword search to a published article, inside a single platform.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "For a small business, that consolidation is the actual selling point. Most SEO stacks require paying for a keyword research tool, a separate content optimizer, a separate AI writer, and then manually publishing everything by hand. Rext AI folds all of that into one subscription and one dashboard.",
          "type": "text",
