              "type": "text",
            },
            {
              "format": 1,
              "text": "Deep keyword research",
              "type": "text",
            },
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": " with real search volume, difficulty scoring, and competitor gap analysis, so you're targeting terms your competitors are already ranking for and terms they're missing entirely.",
