              "type": "text",
            },
            {
              "format": 1,
              "text": "AI blog content generation",
              "type": "text",
            },
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": " that produces publish-ready articles of 2,000+ words from a single keyword or topic, complete with structure, headings, and internal logic rather than a wall of disconnected paragraphs.",
