      ],
      "type": "table",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "For a small business testing the waters, this is a practical way to start. You can clean up technical SEO basics, tighten up existing blog posts, and generate schema markup, all without spending anything, then upgrade to the full platform once you're ready to scale content production. Few competitors in this space offer anywhere near this level of free utility, which makes it worth trying regardless of which paid tool you eventually settle on.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "2. Semrush — Best for Comprehensive Keyword and Competitor Data",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h4",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Semrush remains one of the most complete SEO platforms on the market, and its AI layer (branded as Semrush Copilot and ContentShake AI) adds content suggestions and automated audits on top of an already massive keyword and competitor database.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Strengths:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " Semrush is unmatched for depth in keyword tracking, competitive analysis, backlink data, and site audits all live under one roof. If your business needs to understand exactly what competitors are ranking for and why, this is the tool that gets you there.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Limitations for small businesses:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " the pricing tier that unlocks meaningful functionality sits well above $130 per month, and the interface has a real learning curve. It's a research powerhouse, not a lightweight publishing tool.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "3. Surfer SEO — Best for Content Optimization Scoring",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h4",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Surfer SEO uses natural language processing to analyze top-ranking pages for a given keyword and tells you, in granular detail, what your content needs to include to compete: word count, keyword density, related terms, and structural recommendations.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Strengths:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " if you already have a writer and just need data-backed guidance on what to include, Surfer is precise and fast.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Limitations:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " it doesn't generate full articles or publish for you. You're still doing the writing and the publishing manually, which adds time small teams often don't have.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "4. Frase — Best Budget Content Research Tool",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h4",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Frase combines SERP research, content briefs, and basic AI writing at one of the lowest entry price points in the category, starting around $15 per month.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Strengths:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " excellent value for freelancers and very small teams who need structured research without a big monthly commitment.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Limitations:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " the writing quality and automation depth are noticeably lighter than platforms built around full content generation, so you'll likely outgrow it as your content volume increases.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "5. Ahrefs — Best for Backlinks and Technical SEO",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h4",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Ahrefs built its reputation on backlink data, and that strength hasn't faded. Its AI Content Helper adds writing assistance, but the platform's real value is still in link analysis, keyword difficulty scoring, and technical site audits.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Strengths:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " for businesses focused on off-page SEO and technical health, Ahrefs remains one of the most trusted data sources in the industry.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Limitations:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " content creation is a secondary feature, not the core product, so you'll likely need a separate writing tool alongside it.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "6. SE Ranking — Best Affordable All-in-One Suite",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h4",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "SE Ranking has built a strong reputation among small agencies and lean teams by delivering a large share of what premium tools offer at a fraction of the cost, often starting around $44 per month.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Strengths:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " rank tracking, site audits, and white-label reporting, all at a genuinely accessible price point.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Limitations:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " its AI writing features are less sophisticated than dedicated content platforms, so heavy content producers may find it limiting.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "7. Jasper — Best for AI-Assisted Marketing Copy",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h4",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Jasper is widely used for generating marketing copy, ad text, and blog content, particularly when paired with an SEO data tool like Surfer for optimization guidance.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Strengths:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " strong at producing varied, brand-adjacent copy across formats, not just long-form blog content.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Limitations:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " it doesn't handle SEO research or optimization natively, so it's typically a second tool in a stack rather than a standalone solution.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "8. Clearscope — Best Premium Content Grading Tool",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h4",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Clearscope offers a clean, editor-friendly grading system that scores content against top-ranking competitors, with an interface built for teams that prioritize content quality over speed.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Strengths:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " the reporting is polished and easy for non-SEO staff to understand and act on.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "L",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "imitations:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " at roughly $170–190 per month, it's one of the pricier options here relative to what a very small business typically needs.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "9. Scalenut — Best for High-Volume Content Drafts",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h4",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Scalenut focuses on fast, one-click article generation for businesses that need to produce content at scale without heavy manual editing.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Strengths:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " speed. It's built for volume production rather than deep, individually crafted pieces.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Limitations:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " output quality can feel formulaic if you're not customizing prompts and structure carefully.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "10. Ubersuggest — Best Free Entry Point",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h4",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Ubersuggest remains a solid starting point for businesses that just want basic keyword ideas and competitive insight without paying anything upfront.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Strengths:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " genuinely useful at the free tier, with paid plans starting around $12–29 per month for more depth.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Limitations:",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " it lacks the content generation, on-page scoring, and publishing capability that full-workflow platforms like Rext AI provide.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
