"# Every construct the editor writes

Not a real article: the five real ones have no quotes, code, rules or underline, so this one covers what they don't.

## Text formats

A paragraph with **bold**, *italic*, <u>underlined</u>, ~~struck~~, \`inline code\` and a [link with a title](https://rext.ai/pricing).

### A third-level heading

#### A fourth-level heading

##### A fifth-level heading

###### A sixth-level heading

> A quote that says one thing.
> And a second line of it.

---

1. First step
2. Second step
    - a nested point
    - another nested point
3. Third step

- Unordered item with **bold**
- Unordered item with a [link](https://example.com)

\`\`\`js
const keyword = "seo writer";
console.log(keyword);
\`\`\`

![A chart of organic traffic](https://media.rext.ai/fixtures/constructs-1.png "A chart of organic traffic")

| Plan | Credits | Price |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Starter | 400 | $32/mo |
| Growth | 1,000 | $79/mo |

The last paragraph."
`;

