    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Jasper's current platform documentation confirms that it now covers agents, content pipelines, brand intelligence, research, optimization, and GEO and AI Discovery. Rext AI's documentation emphasizes keyword research, intent, gap analysis, topical clusters, article generation, E-E-A-T optimization, and publishing. The complete ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "Rext AI features",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "title": null,
          "type": "link",
          "url": "https://rext.ai/features",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " overview provides a closer look at how these SEO and content capabilities are connected within the platform.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "The practical difference is less about whether either platform can write an article. Both can. The more useful question is what happens before and after the article is generated. That is where the workflows begin to separate.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "altText": "Jasper vs Rext.AI comparison of AI content features, SEO tools, keyword research, long-form content, and pricing",
          "src": "https://media.rext.ai/fixtures/jasper-vs-rext-ai-which-ai-writing-platform-is-worth-your-investment-1.png",
          "type": "image",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Jasper vs Rext AI Pricing: How Much Do You Actually Pay?",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h2",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Price matters when you're comparing AI content platforms, but the monthly subscription is only part of the equation. The more important question is what is included in that price and how much of your SEO workflow you can keep inside the platform.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "format": 0,
                      "text": "Pricing",
                      "type": "text",
                    },
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph",
                },
              ],
              "headerState": 1,
              "type": "tablecell",
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "format": 0,
                      "text": "Rext AI",
                      "type": "text",
                    },
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph",
                },
              ],
              "headerState": 1,
              "type": "tablecell",
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "format": 0,
                      "text": "Jasper",
                      "type": "text",
                    },
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph",
                },
              ],
              "headerState": 1,
              "type": "tablecell",
            },
          ],
          "type": "tablerow",
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "format": 0,
                      "text": "Entry paid plan",
                      "type": "text",
                    },
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph",
                },
              ],
              "headerState": 0,
              "type": "tablecell",
            },
            {
