          "title": null,
          "type": "link",
          "url": "https://rext.ai/",
        },
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": " takes a broader approach to the SEO content workflow. Instead of stopping at recommendations inside a content editor, it combines keyword research, SERP analysis, outline generation, article generation, EEAT analysis, on-page SEO, humanization, and optional CMS publishing within one workflow. ",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "That makes it worth considering when your main problem is not simply optimizing an existing draft. It is more relevant when you want to reduce the number of separate steps needed to move from a keyword to a publishable article.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
