    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "A useful distinction is the credit system. The company publishes the credit cost for individual actions instead of describing usage only through vague word limits. A standard SEO article is listed at 15 credits, while optional actions can use additional credits. ",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
