    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Annual billing currently reduces paid plan pricing by 20%. The platform also offers a free trial without requiring a card to start. ",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Best For",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h3",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "This approach makes the most sense for marketers, publishers, bloggers, and agencies that want research, generation, optimization, and publishing closer together.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "It may be less relevant if you already have a mature writing stack and only want a dedicated optimization editor.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "4. Clearscope, A Surfer SEO Competitor for Content Optimization",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h2",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Clearscope is a well-established option for teams that care heavily about content quality, optimization, and structured editorial workflows.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Its current offering has also expanded beyond traditional SEO. Clearscope now describes its plans around both SEO and AI search visibility, with tracked prompts and pages included in its packages.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "That makes the platform particularly interesting for established content teams that want to monitor content rather than optimize a draft once and forget about it.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Key Features",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h3",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Clearscope focuses on areas such as:",
