        },
      ],
      "listType": "bullet",
      "tag": "ul",
      "type": "list",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Essentials currently includes 50 tracked prompts, 50 pages, 20 monthly Topic Explorations, and 20 monthly Drafts. Business increases the tracked prompts and pages to 300 each and adds a dedicated account manager. A 14-day free trial is available. ",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "That places Clearscope toward the premium end of this comparison.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Best For",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h3",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Clearscope is worth considering for editorial and content teams that place a high value on optimization quality and do not need the cheapest possible platform.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "If budget is your biggest constraint, lower-priced alternatives may make more sense.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "altText": "Image showing features of different Ai writing tools of surfer alternatives",
          "src": "https://juvrqxhye2tzsl8t.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/clear-scope-vs-frasevs-maeketmuse-vs-newrin-writers-50rf5LIUaGqZ8kyuZNlE0cPiStTnaa.png",
          "type": "image",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "5. Frase, A Surfer SEO Alternative for SERP Research and AI Writing",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h2",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Frase has evolved from an SEO research and optimization product into what it calls a content operating system for AI search.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Its current workflow combines content creation with SEO and GEO scoring, publishing, auditing, and AI visibility features. The Starter plan can publish directly to WordPress, Webflow, Sanity, Wix, or FraseCMS.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "That combination makes Frase attractive when research and writing need to happen in the same environment.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Key Features",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h3",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Depending on the plan, Frase can support:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  SEO and GEO scoring",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 1,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  Content research",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 2,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  Content optimization",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 3,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  AI-assisted writing",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 4,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  Content auditing",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 5,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  AI visibility monitoring",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 6,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  CMS publishing",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 7,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  Content decay monitoring",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 8,
        },
      ],
      "listType": "bullet",
      "tag": "ul",
      "type": "list",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "The practical advantage is workflow continuity. Research does not have to live in one platform, the brief in another, and publishing somewhere else.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "That can matter more than having the longest feature list.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Pricing Plans",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h3",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Frase currently lists its Starter plan at $49 per month when billed monthly, or $39 per month with annual billing. It includes one seat, one site, 10 articles, and 50 audit pages per month. A seven-day trial is available without a credit card.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Higher plans increase capacity and are aimed at content teams with larger workflows.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Best For",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h3",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Frase fits writers and teams that want SERP research, optimization, drafting, and publishing connected in one workflow.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "It is also worth exploring if GEO scoring and AI visibility are becoming part of your content process.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "6. MarketMuse, A Surfer SEO Alternative for Content Strategy",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h2",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "MarketMuse approaches SEO from a different angle.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "While individual page optimization matters, MarketMuse places substantial emphasis on your broader content inventory, topical coverage, gaps, and content strategy.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "This distinction becomes important when a site already has hundreds or thousands of pages.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "At that point, asking "How should we optimize this article?" is only part of the problem.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "You also need to ask:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  Which topic should we cover next?",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 1,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  Where is our authority strongest?",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 2,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  Which existing page deserves an update?",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 3,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  What are we missing?",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 4,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  Which content opportunity deserves resources?",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 5,
        },
      ],
      "listType": "bullet",
      "tag": "ul",
      "type": "list",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "MarketMuse is designed around those larger content decisions.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Key Features",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h3",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Its current platform includes:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  Topic Navigator",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 1,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  Keyword research",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 2,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  SERP X ray",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 3,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  SERP Heatmap",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 4,
        },
        {
