        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Best For",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h3",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "NeuronWriter deserves consideration from freelancers, bloggers, small agencies, and site owners who want NLP SEO tools and content optimization without starting at a high monthly price.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "When comparing Surfer SEO vs NeuronWriter, pay close attention to limits and workflow rather than price alone.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "altText": "Image showing features of different Ai writing tools of surfer alternatives",
          "src": "https://juvrqxhye2tzsl8t.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/semrush--suurfe-and-content-harmion-MBqCryTBzwIa7jyieYQIxfLpdJDq09.png",
          "type": "image",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "8. Semrush SEO Writing Assistant vs Surfer SEO",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h2",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Semrush is the broadest SEO ecosystem in this comparison.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "That makes Semrush vs Surfer SEO slightly different from comparing two dedicated content editors.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Surfer centers heavily on content optimization and related content workflows. Semrush covers a much wider SEO stack, including keyword research, competitor research, site auditing, position tracking, content tools, and more.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "For content specifically, there are two offerings worth understanding.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "The SEO Writing Assistant evaluates areas such as SEO, readability, tone, and originality. Semrush also offers a newer Content Toolkit for ideation, briefs, AI content creation, optimization, and publishing. ",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Key Features",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h3",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "The content ecosystem includes capabilities such as:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  Topic discovery",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 1,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  SEO brief generation",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 2,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
