          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 8,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  SERP backed optimization",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 9,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  Broader keyword and competitor data",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 10,
        },
      ],
      "listType": "bullet",
      "tag": "ul",
      "type": "list",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "The bigger advantage appears when your team already uses Semrush.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Adding content tools to an existing SEO workflow may be simpler than adopting another standalone platform.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Pricing Plans",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h3",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "The Semrush Content Toolkit currently costs $60 per month and offers a seven day free trial. It includes unlimited standard articles, five SEO boosted articles per month, SEO briefs, content ideas, optimization, AI rewriting, and WordPress export. ",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "The separate SEO Toolkit currently starts at $139.95 per month for Pro, while Guru costs $249.95 and Business costs $499.95 monthly. SEO Writing Assistant is included at the Guru level according to Semrush's current plan documentation.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "This distinction matters. Do not assume every Semrush content feature comes with its cheapest SEO subscription.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Best For",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h3",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Semrush makes the most sense when content optimization is only one part of your SEO work.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "If you also need keyword research, technical SEO, competitor analysis, and rank tracking, consolidating tools may be useful.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "If you only want a focused content optimization experience, a dedicated platform may feel simpler.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "9. Content Harmony and WriterZen as Surfer SEO Competitors",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h2",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Not every Surfer SEO competitor tries to solve the same problem.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Content Harmony and WriterZen illustrate this well. One places greater emphasis on structured content workflows and briefs. The other has strong keyword research and clustering functionality.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Content Harmony",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "tag": "h3",
      "type": "heading",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Content Harmony is built around repeatable content workflows.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Each Content Workflow includes a Keyword Report, Content Brief, and Content Grader. This creates a logical process from research to instructions to final optimization. ",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 1,
          "text": "Key Features",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  Keyword reports",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 1,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
              "text": "  Search intent research",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "type": "listitem",
          "value": 2,
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "format": 0,
