        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "It is useful when your challenge begins before the writing stage. Instead of simply asking how to optimize one article, you can research keywords and group related opportunities before building the content.",
