    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "WriterZen currently promotes one time pricing rather than a standard monthly subscription.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "format": 0,
          "text": "Its Keyword Research package is listed at $135 one time, while All In One Basic costs $270 one time. The latter adds Content Creator functionality, up to 50 articles per month, unlimited AI writing, and plagiarism checking. That pricing structure is unusual in a category dominated by subscriptions.",
